Pure Rust port of Intel OIDN

Usage: oidn-rs.exe [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  probe         Print the tensor list of a TZA weights file
  denoise       Denoise an image (EXR / PFM / PHM / HDR / TIFF / PNG / JPG / BMP)
  bench         Benchmark denoising throughput on a synthetic HDR scene
  list-devices  List wgpu adapters visible on this system
  help          Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --device <DEVICE>  Execution backend; CPU never initializes a GPU [default: wgpu] [possible values: cpu, wgpu]
  -h, --help             Print help
  -V, --version          Print version
